                                        text="&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;[1] Inserm. MICI. Disponible sur www.inserm.fr/information-en-sante/dossiers-information/maladies-inflammatoires-chroniques-intestin-mici. Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>[2] ASBL Crohn-RCUH,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mici.be/crohn/tabac-alcool-drogues/&quot;>http://www.mici.be/crohn/tabac-alcool-drogues/&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>[3] Crohn’s &amp;amp; Colitis Foundation of America. The Facts about Inflammatory Bowel Diseases, .https://www.crohnscolitisfoundation.org/sites/default/files/2019-02/Updated%20IBD%20Factbook.pdf,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>[4] Wylezinski LS, et al.. Illuminating an Invisible Epidemic: A Systemic Review of the Clinical and Economic Benefits of Early Diagnosis and Treatment in Inflammatory Disease and Related Syndromes. J Clin Med. 2019 Apr 11;8(4):493. doi: 10.3390/jcm8040493.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>[5]&amp;nbsp;Crohn’s &amp;amp; Colitis Foundation of America. The Facts about Inflammatory Bowel Diseases, .https://www.crohnscolitisfoundation.org/sites/default/files/2019-02/Updated%20IBD%20Factbook.pdf,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>[6]&amp;nbsp;Crohn’s &amp;amp; Colitis Foundation of America. The Facts about Inflammatory Bowel Diseases, .https://www.crohnscolitisfoundation.org/sites/default/files/2019-02/Updated%20IBD%20Factbook.pdf,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>[7] Crohn’s disease. Symptoms and Causes. Mayo Clinic. 2021. Available at:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/crohns-disease/symptoms-causes/syc-20353304.%20Accessed%20on%20May%202&quot;>https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/crohns-disease/symptoms-causes/syc-20353304.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>[8] Mayo Clinic. Ulcerative co